{"id":"e580c19f3796935d","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-metric-open-ball.md","title":"ZFC Metric Open Ball","display":"df-zfc-metric-open-ball — ZFC Metric Open Ball","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-metric-open-ball","aliases":["58-df-zfc-metric-open-ball"],"display":"df-zfc-metric-open-ball — ZFC Metric Open Ball","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-metric]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-metric-open-ball"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-metric-open-ball</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-metric-open-ball — ZFC Metric Open Ball"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"267957a097ff75bf\" href=\"?note=267957a097ff75bf\" title=\"58-df-metric\">58-df-metric</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,x,r,X,d\\in V\">\\(B,x,r,X,d\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Metric}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Metric}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (metric predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"267957a097ff75bf\" href=\"?note=267957a097ff75bf\" title=\"58-df-metric\">58-df-metric</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricOpenBall}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricOpenBall}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}open\\text{-}ball} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricOpenBall}_S(B,x,r,X,d)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)\\land x\\in X\\land r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\land B=\\{y\\in X:d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)&lt;r\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}open\\text{-}ball} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricOpenBall}_S(B,x,r,X,d)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)\\land x\\in X\\land r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\land B=\\{y\\in X:d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)&lt;r\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The metric is applied to the ordered pair <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\)</span>, matching its registered graph domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\times X\">\\(X\\times X\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-metric","status":"resolved","id":"267957a097ff75bf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-metric]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-metric","status":"resolved","id":"267957a097ff75bf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Metric}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (metric predicate, see [[58-df-metric]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B,x,r,X,d\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Metric}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricOpenBall}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}open\\text{-}ball} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricOpenBall}_S(B,x,r,X,d)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)\\land x\\in X\\land r\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\land B=\\{y\\in X:d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)<r\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle x,y\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"X\\times X","display":false}],"bytes":859,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2690","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-metric-open-ball.md|58-df-zfc-metric-open-ball]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","267957a097ff75bf"]}